.TH bhtune-opc-gateway-info 1  "bhtune-opc-gateway-info "
.SH NAME
bhtune\-opc\-gateway\-info \- Report gateway\-wide version and protocol information without contacting an OPC server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-opc\-gateway\-info\fR [\fB\-\-bridge\-host\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report gateway\-wide version and protocol information without contacting an OPC server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-bridge\-host\fR \fI<BRIDGE_HOST>\fR
(default: `crate::config::DEFAULT_BRIDGE_HOST`, overridable via `BHTUNE_BRIDGE_HOST` or the config file\*(Aqs `bridge_host` key.)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
